### Read notification settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/settings
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Configure ntfy (use the authenticated session cookie)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/settings
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "ntfy",
  "enabled": true,
  "url": "https://ntfy.example.com/rincuma-tasks",
  "authorization": "Bearer tk_example"
}

### Remove the notification destination
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notifications/settings
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
